WEBVTT

00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:09.130
We're fighting right now in the galaxy soccer tournament, Grand Celesta Galaxy.

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:12.110
Our next opponent is the planet Sazanaarah.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:16.510
We continue to fight as we aim to be best in the universe.

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:26.000
So, have you at last made your decision to become king?

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:30.460
Why do you want me to be the king of Falam Orbius, Lalaya?

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.130
Tsurugi will make this planet a better place.

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:37.620
That is the feeling I get.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:40.930
That is how I feel when I look into your eyes.

00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:44.440
Isn't this planet good enough already?

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:47.170
I-It is!

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:49.620
You will find no planet better than this one!

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:54.570
But, for some reason... I cannot help but feel troubled.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.070
I don't know why...

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:02.620
Lalaya.

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:06.640
I want to know more about this planet before I decide about becoming its king or not.

00:01:06.970 --> 00:01:09.630
Let me roam freely today, for one day.

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:13.550
You must think me a fool! You intend to run away, don't you!

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:16.550
I'll come back.

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:17.550
I promise.

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:26.860
Very well then, I will allow it.

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:28.680
But only for today.

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:19.170
I was sent here to ensure that Sazanaarah won, so why am I in here?

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:21.170
And all because of that little imp...

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:29.110
Now, why don't we move along by telling me about this boy's frightful Azul.

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:37.110
Azul is the shape of a person's mind that you Sazanaarahns are able to see, correct?

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:42.600
Yes, it is as you say.

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:46.620
Azul is the shape of a person's mind that is visible to us.

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:53.370
An Azul changes in color or shape depending on what that person is thinking of at the time.

00:03:53.930 --> 00:04:00.050
For instance, when one feels happy, their Azul takes the form of a gentle shape and color...

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:05.890
While, if one were to feel hatred, their Azul would cast an ominous shadow.

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:13.860
By looking at that person's Azul, we are able to tell what they are thinking.

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:18.360
If only you were able to see our Azul right now as well, Lady Hilary.

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:25.880
With our ability to see Azul, our victory is assured.

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:31.660
We insist that Lady Hilary leave this match in our hands and relax instead from the fatigue of your long journey.

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:35.620
W-W-Wait! What are you doing?!

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:40.620
And they kicked me out just like that.

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:42.880
But this feels great, so whatever.

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:53.850
But the moment the tables turn on them, I, Hilary Flail of Falam Orbius's Shitennou, will crush Earth Eleven.

00:04:57.910 --> 00:05:00.360
This is where we're holding the match, is it?

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:06.860
The Sazanaarahns are able to see our minds. It's going to be a tough fight tomorrow.

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:13.000
But despite what powers they have, we just have to play our soccer.

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:15.410
We'll fight back at them on full power!

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:16.750
Yeah!

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:22.150
Welcome to the cosmic soccer world!

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:27.240
I, the super commentator Ducksgun Babyu, am here to bring you the commentary!

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:37.000
Today, Grand Celesta Galaxy's second match, Sazanaarah versus Earth Eleven, is brought to you live from Sazanaarah!

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:46.990
Oh, look at that!

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:49.990
Earth Eleven is entering the stadium!

00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:59.820
What's with that Azul? It's a total mess!

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.950
And it's pitch-black.

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:04.910
I think this is my first time seeing an Azul so hideous!

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:06.090
Scary!

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:10.530
They're looking at us.

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:12.850
They're looking at our minds.

00:06:18.530 --> 00:06:21.310
Look. There's someone from another planet again on their team.

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:23.170
That one, huh?

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:25.320
Her face looks kind of glossy, don't you think?

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:31.710
Powai may have heard about it, but Powai didn't expect it to be that ugly.

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:35.550
Powai has never seen an Azul so murky!

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:39.710
But this Azul over here looks really pretty!

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:43.250
It's like he has total faith in others. Like he feels a close bond!

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.470
Powai just thought of something fun!

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:51.180
Destroy their Azul?

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:53.040
Good idea, don't you think?

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:57.350
Just imagining Powai's plan gives Powai shivers!

00:06:58.420 --> 00:06:59.440
I can't wait!

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:03.660
Nothing less from our Lady Powai. It is a most excellent plan.

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:05.110
Right?

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:07.480
It would be boring if we just won.

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:10.370
They act like they have all the time in the world.

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:13.460
Well, let's see what you can do.

00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:16.910
You want to sit out?

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:20.110
I haven't been feeling well since this morning.

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:21.170
Tsurugi?

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:23.130
Are you okay?

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:24.970
Yeah...

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:26.880
I just feel a bit tired.

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:29.330
If you say so...

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:32.970
We're playing without our ace striker, huh... 
That puts us in an even more difficult position.

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:35.370
Ichikawa.

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:36.640
You're up as forward.

00:07:39.110 --> 00:07:41.060
I thought you would say that.

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:44.200
Yay, it's almost kickoff time!

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:48.570
Who will win this match, Sazanaarah or Earth Eleven?!

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:53.070
Their helper is starting off on the bench, huh?

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:00.660
These guys are just like them...

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:02.920
They can see my mind...

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:07.020
<i>You're a lonely guy, I see.</i>

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:12.630
<i>It's no wonder you don't have any friends who care about you.</i>

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:16.800
Smile like the brainless lot you are while you still can.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:20.220
I will destroy you!

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:22.640
Oh yeah!

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:24.900
The match begins with Sazanaarah's kickoff!

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:26.400
It's mine!

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:30.730
Oh! Valha dodges him! {ヴァルハ}

00:08:31.420 --> 00:08:32.800
He did it so easily!

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:34.530
Was he looking at his thoughts?

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:36.570
Miss Churuka! {チュルカさん}

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:41.510
Kusaka!

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:42.370
He got it?! {i propose that the only reason kusaka was able to do this was because his head is full of morimura}

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:45.970
Yay! Earth Eleven steals the ball this time!

00:08:45.970 --> 00:08:46.580
Captain!

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:48.000
Sakura!

00:08:48.550 --> 00:08:50.310
Their passes move up!

00:08:51.310 --> 00:08:55.220
What's going on? Aren't they able to see our thoughts?

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:58.430
They should be able to tell what our pass course is by seeing what we're thinking.

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:02.390
So why are our passes connecting so easily?

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:04.510
Hey, you there!

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:07.000
Are you making fun of us?

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:09.970
Regardless of our ability, we've been chosen to represent our planet through soccer,

00:09:09.970 --> 00:09:13.200
so it's only natural that we fight soccer with soccer.

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:15.900
Don't put us in the category as those rogues you met in town.

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:19.370
Heh, there she goes saying stuff that she's not sincerely thinking.

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:24.710
Then, do you mean to tell us that you will not be using your ability to see people's minds?

00:09:25.310 --> 00:09:30.340
If you look at it another way, it means that we'll win without having to resort to using our powers.

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:33.710
Earth Eleven is still keeping the ball!

00:09:36.730 --> 00:09:38.680
Waterfall!

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:43.930
There it is! Sazanaarah's hissatsu technique!

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:46.600
Seban!

00:09:47.130 --> 00:09:51.690
Whoa! The ball moves up to the goal in an instant! He's completely free!

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:53.910
Left or right?

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:55.190
Which way will he aim?

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:03.620
Bubble Boil!

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:05.750
The right!

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:07.750
Too bad. It's a straight course.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:10.260
What?!

00:10:11.930 --> 00:10:14.170
Oh yeah, it's in!

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:16.010
Sazanaarah makes the first point!

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:19.220
I suppose they have <i>some</i>  skill.

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:22.220
Damn it, it was a straight course!

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:27.430
Ibuki.

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:30.950
It's still one point!

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:32.350
We'll get it back!

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:33.230
Yeah!

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:36.970
If they're not seeing our thoughts, then we're on the same level ground!

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:38.530
We won't lose!

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:43.310
That's it. We need you to do your best.

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:46.240
It's only going to get fun from here!

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:48.960
Pit their Azul against each other?

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:50.260
Yep.

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:55.710
That Azul and that Azul?

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:56.950
That's right.

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:59.860
But it won't be fun making them collide with each other the way they are now...

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:03.510
So we'll do it after we've made the ugly one even uglier.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:07.150
I wonder what will happen to it when it strikes against that pretty Azul...

00:11:07.150 --> 00:11:09.230
Something fun is going to happen!

00:11:09.510 --> 00:11:14.230
By making those two opposite Azul collide with each other, they'll self-destruct, huh?

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:24.730
That sounds like fun! Let's do it!

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:30.960
I can't wait.

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:34.820
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:40.220
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:47.390
Yay! Grand Celesta Galaxy's second match has Sazanaarah in a one-point lead!

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:49.850
The match resumes with Earth Eleven's kickoff!

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:53.220
Those bastards keep grinning.

00:11:53.220 --> 00:11:55.530
I'll wipe those smirks off your faces.

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:01.450
Whoa! Matatagi rushes in at superspeed!

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:02.650
I'll stop you!

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:04.730
He gets through!

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:08.330
You guys can't keep up with my speed!

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:12.000
Sakura! Kusaka!

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:21.090
C'mon! Will Matatagi be able to bring the ball all the way to the goal?!

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.720
That's as far as you go!

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:31.730
Waterfall!

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:36.110
Matatagi!

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:39.520
Sazanaarah is on the offense this time!

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:40.690
I'll stop you!

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:42.190
Miss Churuka!

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:46.030
Whoa, whoa! Sazanaarah's passes connect!

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:48.530
Oh yeah! There's Sazanaarah's fierce attack!

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:52.540
Earth Eleven faces them boldly, but they are unable to take back the ball!

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:59.110
Sazanaarah's indomitable ball control continues!

00:12:59.110 --> 00:13:03.050
The game is moving on completely at Sazanaarah's pace!

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:05.930
Doing what you please.

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:07.760
I'll stop you!

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:10.970
Matatagi steals it back!

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:11.970
Yes!

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:14.420
Not again!

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:16.080
Where are you looking?

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:19.060
Oh! The ball goes back again to Sazanaarah!

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:21.950
Only time keeps ticking on, baby!

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:24.570
The match is 1-0 with Sazanaarah in the lead!

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:30.280
Will the first half end without development? Earth Eleven isn't finding an opening for attack!

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:32.370
Over here, Kusaka!

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:39.330
Captain!

00:13:39.570 --> 00:13:40.590
Okay!

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:51.570
Why are you letting schmucks like them take the ball?!

00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:54.170
You guys keep dragging me down!

00:13:54.170 --> 00:13:58.280
I'm not able to bring out my abilities because you're all worthless!

00:13:59.510 --> 00:14:01.040
That's it.

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:03.780
His Azul is turning even uglier.

00:14:09.150 --> 00:14:12.440
There's definitely something weird about this match.

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:14.750
We're not able to take back the ball at all.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:18.840
Are they really keeping their word and not looking at our thoughts?

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:21.840
But if they are looking...

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:27.260
Oh! Matatagi takes back the ball again!

00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:31.000
Why is Matatagi the only one able to get the ball?

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:35.020
But then, right before Matatagi reaches the goal, they make sure to bring him down.

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:38.520
No! That was a hard play!

00:14:39.150 --> 00:14:42.020
What are they thinking?!

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:48.110
Too bad.

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:51.320
You think you can get through us? Just give up.

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:56.970
Sazanaarah has stopped moving! Aren't they going to attack?

00:14:56.970 --> 00:14:59.500
Matatagi lays prostrate on the ground, unmoving!

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:00.910
Matatagi!

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:03.750
Matatagi!

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:04.950
Are you okay?

00:15:05.530 --> 00:15:07.800
Don't bother coming now, it's too late.

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:09.130
Stop acting like you're my friends.

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:12.860
Whose fault is it anyway that I'm like this in the first place?!

00:15:17.820 --> 00:15:20.100
Matatagi, you're not hurt, are you?

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:21.310
Y-Yeah...

00:15:25.950 --> 00:15:27.360
It begins.

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:29.070
What's so funny?

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:30.770
Oh, come on!

00:15:30.770 --> 00:15:32.020
"You're not hurt, are you?"

00:15:32.020 --> 00:15:33.020
"Yeah..."

00:15:33.020 --> 00:15:35.580
You're talking to each other as if you're friends!

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:38.370
"As if" we're friends?

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:39.540
What are you talking about?

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:44.510
Quit playing your little game of friendship already.

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:45.860
And you!

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:48.670
If you have something that's on your mind, say it out loud!

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:51.630
Something that's on your mind?

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:55.200
We're able to see crystal clear what you're thinking.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:58.020
This is how you've always thought about them!

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:00.730
"You guys keep dragging me down."

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:05.150
"I'm not able to bring out my abilities because you're all worthless."

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:09.570
I see!

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:12.610
They were trying to make Matatagi lose his composure.

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:22.400
You don't trust anyone.

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:25.420
"Even if I left it to these guys, they can't get the ball back."

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.250
"There's no point expecting them to do anything right."

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:28.920
"Stop acting like you're my friends."

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.310
M-Matatagi...

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:36.390
What's with you guys?!

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:38.150
That's right!

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:39.970
That's the kind of person I am!

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:41.420
But what of it?!

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:43.840
People can't be trusted!

00:16:44.110 --> 00:16:48.000
That's right! I've never trusted any of you even once!

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:50.640
Why are you guys able to put your trust in total strangers?!

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:53.000
I'm not that naïve!

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:55.160
I just kept acting like I was a good guy!

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:58.840
That's me! That's Matatagi Hayato!

00:16:58.840 --> 00:17:01.160
I won't let any of you criticize me for who I am!

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:15.620
It's coming... It's coming...

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:17.930
There's nothing to criticize.

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:25.890
I'd been feeling that there was some part of you that didn't trust us.

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:27.100
What?

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:31.060
But why did you hide that?

00:17:31.060 --> 00:17:34.110
Why did you try to show yourself as a good person in front of us?

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:36.080
Why?

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:37.550
Because that's the mature thing to do.

00:17:37.550 --> 00:17:38.740
No.

00:17:39.460 --> 00:17:42.420
You hated yourself, didn't you?

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:46.210
The truth is, you want to trust us, but you hated yourself for being unable to do that.

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:49.820
You pretended because you want to be closer to us than anyone.

00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:53.800
You want to trust your friends more than any of us, isn't that what you're thinking?

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:58.280
That's not true!

00:17:58.280 --> 00:18:02.730
I'm different from you fresh-faced nerds all eager to spend your days in happy land! {yeah i'm not sure how to translate this}

00:18:02.730 --> 00:18:04.810
I'm a bad guy!

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:10.060
So what if you are a bad guy?

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:14.820
There's no one who doesn't have a bit of an evil side to them.

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:19.320
Even I am not as good of a person as the roles I play suggest.

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:23.200
What's going on?

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:24.770
Why isn't he breaking?

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:26.420
That's right!

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:28.860
Any one of us has evil inside.

00:18:28.860 --> 00:18:31.750
But it's up to us to get past that and accept it.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:35.930
All of the good things and bad things about you are what make you Matatagi Hayato!

00:18:35.930 --> 00:18:39.050
<i>All</i>  of them are what make you my friend, Matatagi Hayato!

00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:43.560
My good <i>and</i>  bad sides are what make me, me...

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:46.460
Does he really believe that...?

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:55.150
Seriously...

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:57.900
You're an interesting guy!

00:18:58.480 --> 00:18:59.610
It's here.

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:04.200
Whoa! Play suddenly resumes!

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:05.450
Garila!

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:06.790
You're not getting away!

00:19:08.570 --> 00:19:09.970
Go, Matatagi!

00:19:09.970 --> 00:19:10.670
Ness!

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:15.000
I just have to look at your Azul to know what you're thinking...

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:24.640
My head...!

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:27.390
You won't make the goal!

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:30.890
Just try and stop me!

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:41.130
Aqua Breath!

00:19:44.170 --> 00:19:45.970
Goal!

00:19:45.970 --> 00:19:47.240
He did it!

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:50.000
That's Matatagi's Soul!

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:54.040
There's the whistle signaling the end of the first half!

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:57.550
The first half ends with Earth Eleven tying the score!

00:19:57.800 --> 00:19:58.600
Yes!

00:19:58.600 --> 00:19:59.550
It's a tie!

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:04.620
Matatagi!

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:08.270
You did it! That was amazing!

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:10.080
Captain.

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:12.510
Sorry, but this is who I am.

00:20:12.510 --> 00:20:14.200
If you don't like it, you can always-

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:15.930
It finally happened.

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:19.000
If this is the real Matatagi Hayato...

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:22.680
Then I've finally become friends with the real you.

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:24.360
I'm so glad!

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:26.160
Captain...

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:29.700
Huh? Did something change about you, Matatagi?

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:34.000
Just so you know, I'm different from who I was before.

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:38.960
You guys had better exert yourselves in training so you can keep up with my speed.

00:20:43.020 --> 00:20:44.550
Just saying.

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:53.480
What's with that Azul?

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:56.710
It's unbelievable to think he had such power...

00:20:56.710 --> 00:20:58.110
It's my turn now.

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:02.570
As if we'd ever rely on you.

00:21:16.530 --> 00:21:17.920
Anyone else with a problem?

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:21.800
Just you wait.

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:24.680
You will be fighting me this time.

00:22:52.930 --> 00:23:07.860
Next Episode

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:57.280
Earth Eleven has a tough fight against a team that can read minds!

00:22:57.280 --> 00:23:01.330
But Minaho thinks up a strategy that's certain to help us win!

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:03.600
Next, Minaho's Own Goal!

00:23:03.600 --> 00:23:05.570
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:19.640
The Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy's proverb today is...

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:26.800
All of the good things and bad things about you are what make you my friend!

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:27.950
That's all!
